. 
. /* Test for no cointegration with and without demeaning 
>    (first subtracting the cross-sectional averages from the series) the data
> */
. * Kao test for cointegration
. xtcointtest kao lny1 lnx1 lnx2 lnx3

Kao test for cointegration
